  <data name="Info_License_Body" xml:space="preserve">
    <value># Vacuo
Vacuo is distributed under the MIT License. © 2026 Alican Kaya.

Anyone may use, copy, modify, merge, publish, distribute and sell the software free of charge, as long as the copyright line and the permission notice are kept in every copy. The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.

# Components used
